  "title": {
   "en": "3-Pun Matte Mugi-Senpai"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "3分待ってむぎ先輩"
   },
   {
    "en": "Wait 3 Minutes, Mugi-senpai"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Three minutes with hot water.\n\nEating cup noodles with her senpai Mugi is the most delicious thing in the world! Yuasa Shio is a university student who does her research both day and night, and Yakushiji Tsumugi is a graduate student who is her mentor. Today, they continue to push forward with their university life and conduct their research to the best of their abilities, and then, late at night in the laboratory after their research is done for the day, they reward themselves with noodles ー cup noodles, that is. \n\nThis is a story of two science students' adolescence, research, love, and cup noodles.\n\nCup Noodle, Maruchan Akai Kitsune Green Tanuki, Peyoung... Dazzling cup noodles appear with real names! The cup noodles appearing in this work are used with the permission of the rights holders.",
   "ja": "お湯を入れて3分。\nむぎ先輩と食べるカップ麺が何より美味しい！\n日夜研究を続ける大学生の湯浅汐と、その教育担当である大学院生の薬師寺つむぎ。\n二人は今日も大学生活、そして研究に精一杯邁進して、そして深夜の研究室。\nご褒美ご飯のカップ麺にありつくのだった。理系女子大生の青春、研究と恋とカップ麺のお話。\n\nカップヌードル、マルちゃん赤いきつね緑のたぬき、ペヤング…めくるめくるカップ麺が実名で登場！\n※本作品に登場するカップ麺は権利元に確認、許諾をいただいて使用しています。"
  },
